<p class="meta">Updated October 2026 · New York</p>

<aside class="rail">
  <p class="rail-title">Tools</p>
  <p class="muted" style="margin: 0 0 1.5rem;">Claude Code most of the day, with a custom status line. Obsidian for notes and drafts. PostHog for error tracking.</p>
