<h2>Work</h2>
<p>I'm looking for my next role: forward deployed, AI engineering, or senior product engineering. If that's you, <%= mail_to Profile.email, "email me" %> or <%= link_to "grab a time", meet_path %>.</p>
<p>Until then I take small, fixed-scope projects: MCP servers, RAG, agents and eval setup. <%= link_to "Here's what that looks like", hire_path %>.</p>

<h2>Building</h2>
<ul>
  <li><%= link_to "aCoach", work_item_path("acoach") %>, an AI coach that reviews League of Legends games from Riot's match data, in Python and Postgres.</li>
  <li>Getting <%= link_to "aTempo", work_item_path("atempo") %>, <%= link_to "aNote", work_item_path("anote") %> and <%= link_to "MealScan", work_item_path("mealscan") %> onto the App Store.</li>
  <li>A chess game review tool I can run myself: paste a game, step through it, and get the engine's lines explained.</li>
  <li>This site, which just got rebuilt.</li>
</ul>

